Agentic Use-Case Governance Checklist catalog
=============================================

All section titles, intents, and checklist items in
agentic-governance-catalog.json are original wording authored for AIGP.

This catalog was informed at a directional level by industry commentary on
agentic-AI governance, but reproduces NO third-party publication text. It is
not derived from, and does not include, any copyrighted source material.
